      [38;5;220m│[39m                                                                                                          [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  UX review Claude in this discobox changed its settings or signed in.                                    [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m                                                                                                          [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  Saving makes those settings, and that login, the shared default for every discobox on UX review Claude  [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  in this project: new discoboxes start with them, and a saved login is the one all of them use.          [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m                                                                                                          [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  Settings can include hooks and commands, which then run in every discobox on UX review Claude: read     [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  what changed before you save it.                                                                        [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m                                                                                                          [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  Nothing is shared until you save. Discarding the change, or leaving it, keeps it in this discobox       [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  only.                                                                                                   [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m                                                                                                          [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  Whenever a box has a change to save, a green band says so and H behind the leader reviews it.           [38;5;220m│[39m
