      [38;5;220m│[39m  [38;5;220m❯[39m [38;5;220mr[39m  [1mReview changes[0m  [38;5;240msee what changed, then save or discard it[39m                                          [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m    [38;5;220mn[39m  [38;5;240mNot now       [39m  [38;5;240mthe band and H stay to review it later[39m                                             [38;5;220m│[39m
